UID:IgF6Lji0Ip3sPFouxbJC7
SUMMARY:Monthly Tandem Bike Riding with Achilles International - August 202
	6
DTSTAMP:20260812T042901Z
DTSTART:20260822T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Ride in Tandem – Inclusive Cycling with The Lighthouse and Achi
	lles International\nDon’t miss the thrill of our upcoming tandem bike ride
	 days! In partnership with Achilles International\, we’re bringing togethe
	r riders of all abilities for a fully inclusive tandem cycling workout\, f
	ollowed by a relaxed breakfast social to refuel and connect. \nWhere: Stud
	e Park – 1031 Stude Street\, Houston\, TX 77007 \nWhen: Usually every Satu
	rday of the month\, 8:00–10:00 AM. Check our events calendar for exact dat
	es. \nPLEASE NOTE: If you are already an Achilles member\, please register
	 by Friday at 8:00 AM. If you are not yet an Achilles member\, please comp
	lete their free membership form here: https://achillesinternational.roster
	fy.com/register \nFor questions regarding tandem rides\, please contact Mi
	chaela with Achilles Houston at 346-819-7465. \nWant to make an even bigge
	r impact? Volunteers are needed to help guide riders\, assist with equipme
	nt\, and keep the event running smoothly. Whether you’re an experienced cy
	clist or just eager to lend a hand\, your support helps ensure a safe\, fu
	n\, and welcoming experience for all participants. \nFor more details or t
	o volunteer\, call 713-284-8424\, email youthadultservices@houstonlighthou
	se.org\, or visit the Achilles International Houston website. \nREGISTER H
	ERE. \n \n\nhttps://houstonlighthouse.org/event/monthly-tandem-bike-riding
	-with-achilles-international-august-2026/2026-08-22/\n\nFrom Houston Light
	house
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/monthly-tandem-bike-riding-with-ach
	illes-international-august-2026/2026-08-22/
LOCATION:Stude Park\, 1031 Stude Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77007
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-lighthouse
CATEGORIES:Houston Lighthouse
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
